<title>UK: Shell up after Dresdner Kleinwort upgrade.</title>
<headline>Shell up after Dresdner Kleinwort upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Shell Transport climbed to a 10-week high, bolstered by an upgrade by Dresdner Kleinwort Benson, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares were up 11-1/2p to 1021-1/2 by 1038 GMT.  </p>
<p>The brokerage said it raised its recommendation on Shell stock to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;hold&quot; based on valuations.</p>
<p>--Debra Sherman, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
